* HX711 behavioural front-end
.include simulation/electronics/models/hx711_amp.lib
Vdd vdd 0 DC 3.3
Vss vss 0 DC 0
Vcm cm 0 DC 1.6500 AC 0
Rth1 sp cm 500
Rth2 sn cm 500
Rf1 sp mid 1k
Vd e2 mid DC 0
Rf2 sn inn 1k
C16 e2 inn 100n
Xamp e2 inn out vdd vss hx711_amp GAIN=128 VOFF=1.6500 ROUT=1k CFILT=15.9u
Rload out 0 1G
.control
op
print v(out) v(e2) v(inn)
.endc
.end
